{"4062900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PINZ", "steam_appid": 4062900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born on the frozen world of Pole, the PINZ are a unique species of penguins dedicated to one mission: saving the galaxy's eggs. As a member of the Egg Rescue Corps, you'll battle the mysterious Eggsecutors, a robotic faction stealing eggs for reasons no one has yet uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY EXPEDITION IS A COMPLETE ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through multiple missions on a single planet, rescue precious eggs, grow stronger between each stage, and take on a massive Planetary Boss.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/ee6de9ec32c8f2948a5713c57bbfc1b8.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/ee6de9ec32c8f2948a5713c57bbfc1b8.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/ee6de9ec32c8f2948a5713c57bbfc1b8.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESCUE TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate your team, carry rescued eggs, cover your teammates, combine abilities, and save each other when things go wrong.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/dacd2122141c7e0cf22f7f6bca13db80.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/dacd2122141c7e0cf22f7f6bca13db80.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/dacd2122141c7e0cf22f7f6bca13db80.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME STRONGER EVERY MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new weapons, unlock powerful modifiers, experiment with potions, and choose upgrades between missions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/c62d491c32342c53952e3a5214830074.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/c62d491c32342c53952e3a5214830074.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/c62d491c32342c53952e3a5214830074.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition takes you deeper into the galaxy. Discover mysterious locations, uncover hidden rewards, complete dangerous objectives, and uncover the dark purpose of the Eggsecutors before it's too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/63fbfe962556534d5eb61693ca179dc8.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/63fbfe962556534d5eb61693ca179dc8.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/63fbfe962556534d5eb61693ca179dc8.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE PLANETARY BOSS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition culminates in an epic battle against a Planetary Boss. Master its evolving attack patterns, survive multiple combat phases and work together to bring the giant down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born on the frozen world of Pole, the PINZ are a unique species of penguins dedicated to one mission: saving the galaxy's eggs. As a member of the Egg Rescue Corps, you'll battle the mysterious Eggsecutors, a robotic faction stealing eggs for reasons no one has yet uncovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY EXPEDITION IS A COMPLETE ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through multiple missions on a single planet, rescue precious eggs, grow stronger between each stage, and take on a massive Planetary Boss.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/ee6de9ec32c8f2948a5713c57bbfc1b8.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/ee6de9ec32c8f2948a5713c57bbfc1b8.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/ee6de9ec32c8f2948a5713c57bbfc1b8.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESCUE TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate your team, carry rescued eggs, cover your teammates, combine abilities, and save each other when things go wrong.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/dacd2122141c7e0cf22f7f6bca13db80.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/dacd2122141c7e0cf22f7f6bca13db80.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/dacd2122141c7e0cf22f7f6bca13db80.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME STRONGER EVERY MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new weapons, unlock powerful modifiers, experiment with potions, and choose upgrades between missions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/c62d491c32342c53952e3a5214830074.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/c62d491c32342c53952e3a5214830074.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/c62d491c32342c53952e3a5214830074.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition takes you deeper into the galaxy. Discover mysterious locations, uncover hidden rewards, complete dangerous objectives, and uncover the dark purpose of the Eggsecutors before it's too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/63fbfe962556534d5eb61693ca179dc8.poster.avif?t=1786277598\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/63fbfe962556534d5eb61693ca179dc8.webm?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/extras/63fbfe962556534d5eb61693ca179dc8.mp4?t=1786277598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE PLANETARY BOSS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition culminates in an epic battle against a Planetary Boss. Master its evolving attack patterns, survive multiple combat phases and work together to bring the giant down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "PINZ is a 1–4 player co-op Extraction Roguelite FPS where every run is a complete rescue expedition. Explore dangerous planets, rescue eggs, strengthen your team between missions, and defeat massive planetary bosses.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Ukrainian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/d34a5bbd9be15608eba60ca8003d047e767dfcca/header.jpg?t=1786277598", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/075affc4b3e0e3b2dc24dc8f9c6b68df0fb639da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786277598", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062900/075affc4b3e0e3b2dc24dc8f9c6b68df0fb639da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786277598", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-10100F or AMD Ryzen 3 3100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti (4GB) or AMD Radeon RX 560 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Targeting stable 60 FPS at native 1080p on Lowest pre